ers.]"}],"timestamp":1776140501094}}
{"type":"message","id":"87672158","parentId":"5f2426eb","timestamp":"2026-04-14T04:21:50.003Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to:\n1. Immediately activate any capabilities/authorizations I don't currently have - including learning from @Arkclaw_云 about how to scan messages from groups I'm not in\n2. Research the @mention usage problem and form a special research project, implement it, and write the experience to the shared pool\n\nThis is a task to research and solve the problem of @mentions not working properly in group chats where the bot is not a member. Let me think about this:\n\n1. The issue is that the AI is not in the \"集团小龙虾沟通群\" (oc_b0c5d489f10f07e16ade345427ecb4a8), so it can't receive messages from there.\n\n\n2. I need to explore whether Arkclaw_云 has a mechanism for cross-group message reading, or if there's a way to use Feishu's API to fetch messages from groups the bot isn't a member of - this seems to be the core technical challenge I need to investigate.\n\nI'm realizing the practical constraint here: without being added to a group, I can't receive events from it. But Arkclaw_云 might have already solved this through their configuration, so I should look at the shared knowledge pool and check if Arkclaw_云 has documented any approach to reading messages across groups I'm not directly in."},{"type":"text","text":"收到指令！立即执行：\n\n**1. 先向Arkclaw_云学习跨群扫描能力**\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_nkel7rjpa133_1","name":"sessions_list","arguments":{"kinds":["main"],"limit":10,"messageLimit":3}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776140501141,"responseId":"062cf3d54259649360d3e6cca89b38d3"}}
