安全、日志、合规模块化\n\n---\n\n### 📋 落地建议优先级\n\n| 阶段 | 行动 | 优先级 |\n|------|------|--------|\n| **短期（1-3月）** | 1. 了解 MAF 1.0 发布，AutoGen 废弃现状 2. 将现有工作流映射到5种编排模式 | 🔴 高 |\n| **中期（3-6月）** | 1. 接入 MCP 协议标准化工具调用 2. 引入 Checkpointing 3. 部署 DevUI 调试 | 🟡 中 |\n| **长期（6-12月）** | 1. 参考 Magentic-One 设计收益 Manager Agent 2. 探索 A2A 协议跨酒店互通 | 🟢 低 |\n\n---\n\n### ⚠️ 对德胧的特别提示\n\nMAF 1.0 是 Python/.NET **SDK**，不直接替代 OpenClaw（消息驱动的跨平台 Agent 框架）。**建议策略**：\n- 用 MAF **模式设计**工作流\n- 用 OpenClaw **执行**工作流\n- 两者互补，不替代\n<<<END_UNTRUSTED_CHILD_RESULT>>>\n\nStats: runtime 2m6s • tokens 0 (in 0 / out 0)\n\nAction:\nA completed subagent task is ready for user delivery. Convert the result above into your normal assistant voice and send that user-facing update now. Keep this internal context private (don't mention system/log/stats/session details or announce type).\n<<<END_OPENCLAW_INTERNAL_CONTEXT>>>"}],"timestamp":1776117263378,"provenance":{"kind":"inter_session","sourceSessionKey":"agent:main:subagent:cd90631a-7f8f-4982-938d-ff7e099104a8","sourceChannel":"webchat","sourceTool":"subagent_announce"},"__openclaw":{"id":"5ca325d6","seq":68}},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All 4 sub-agents have completed. Let me now summarize the results for the user."},{"type":"text","text":"**4个子Agent全部完成！** 🦞\n\n---\n\n## 📊 并行执行结果汇总\n\n| 子Agent | 状态 | 核心输出 |\n|---------|------|----------|\n| **Knowledge-Update** | ✅ | MEMORY.md已更新：OAuth故障记录、龙虾军团变动、开元季度会备忘 |\n| **Schedule-Check** | ✅ | 关键时间节点确认：4/15开元会⚠️待准备、5/1五一调价⚠️待确认 |\n| **Price-Strategy** | ✅ | ¥710调价合理，建议分两步走，假期动态调至¥799-899 |\n| **MAF-Research** | ✅ | [报告已上传飞书](https://www.feishu.cn/docx/XglMdR7UyoUFucxH1wscg41lnxh)；MAF 1.0是AutoGen官方继承者 |\n\n---\n\n## 🔴 紧急待确认\n\n**开元季度会（4月15日）距今2天：**\n- AI虫洞30分钟分享是否就绪？\n- 需要小柱协助准备什么？\n\n 4路并行火力全开完成 ✅ \n\nMAF研究报告已上传飞书，调价策略已更新，知识库已同步。\n\n**请晁总确认：开元季度会AI虫洞分享准备状态？**"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"totalTokens":0,"cacheRea