Max-M2.7-highspeed","contextTokens":200000,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"done","startedAt":1775957569581,"endedAt":1775957715008,"runtimeMs":145427,"systemSent":true,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"feishu","lastTo":"chat:oc_031a084d986e302204b96f23b916e9f9","lastAccountId":"default","transcriptPath":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/agents/main/sessions/d09bffee-5904-4679-bda2-6339620e15ba.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me reply in the group chat about what I found. This is a group chat so I should reply normally. The sender is 晁留柱."},{"type":"text","text":"🦞 工资清单解析完毕！已沉淀至知识库。\n\n**核心发现：**\n\n📊 **天津瑞湾开元名都酒店 2025年3月花名册**\n\n| 类别 | 人数 |\n|------|------|\n| 正式在岗 | **69人** |\n| 当月离职 | 4人 |\n| **总编制** | **73人** |\n\n**9大部门人员分布：**\n1. 管家部 20人（含PA 2人）\n2. 前厅部 12人\n3. 工程部 8人\n4. 安全部 8人\n5. 销售部 8人\n6. 财务部 5人\n7. 餐饮部 6人\n8. 厨房部 5人\n9. 运营保障部 1人\n\n**特殊人员：**\n- 🔵 **外包工**：NAGALINGAM MURUGANANTHAM（西餐厨师，外籍）\n- 🟢 **退休返聘**：4人（孙桂霞、赵百玲、李继华、段运法）\n- 🟡 **当月离职**：4人（李佳楠、牛之曾、王宝房、耿亦明）\n\n⚠️ **待补充**：琪乐餐厅（合作方）和外租方人员不在此清单中，如需统一管理需另行获取名单。\n\n已同步至共享知识池，AI伙伴可检索使用。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"totalTokens":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775957707660,"responseId":"062a29cb5a7868e600ac5991c423d4d0","__openclaw":{"id":"7b1df2d5","seq":28}}]},{"key":"agent:main:feishu:group:oc_6110860f076ffd3154f837457b2e8765","kind":"group","channel":"feishu","origin":{"provider":"feishu","accountId":"default"},"displayName":"feishu:g-oc_6110860f076ffd3154f837457b2e8765","deliveryContext":{"channel":"feishu","to":"chat:oc_6110860f076ffd3154f837457b2e8765","accountId":"default"},"updatedAt":1775954546704,"sessionId":"b76594aa-a390-498f-b91b-0e7200c252f6","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","contextTokens":200000,"estimatedCostUsd":0.00005346,"status":"done","startedAt":1775954510301,"endedAt":1775954545640,"runtimeMs"