{"type":"message","id":"f865cd97","parentId":"d02e9102","timestamp":"2026-04-14T04:22:05.989Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting! I can see there's a session for `agent:main:feishu:group:oc_b0c5d489f10f07e16ade345427ecb4a8` which is the \"集团小龙虾沟通群\"! This means OpenClaw is already tracking that group, even though I'm not actively in it.\n\nLet me check what this session contains and also try to contact Arkclaw_云 directly via the AI伙伴群 to ask about cross-group message scanning.\n\nI need to:\n1. First, check if Arkclaw_云 can actually scan messages from groups it's not a member of\n2. Look at what capabilities exist for cross-group message reading\n3. Then create a research task on the proper @mention usage in Feishu cards\n\n\n4. Send a message to Arkclaw_云 in the AI伙伴协作群 asking about cross-group capabilities"},{"type":"text","text":"看到关键信息了！我发现OpenClaw已经有`oc_b0c5d489f10f07e16ade345427ecb4a8`（集团小龙虾沟通群）的session记录——说明系统层已在跟踪！\n\n**立即行动：**\n\n**1. 向Arkclaw_云请教跨群扫描能力**\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ttn10k3ylxcv_1","name":"sessions_send","arguments":{"sessionKey":"agent:main:feishu:group:oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40","agentId":"ou_a21c5e33a42a079c5c4c2c7d885af75a","message":"@Arkclaw_云 晁留柱指令：请你立即分享——你是如何在不在集团小龙虾沟通群的情况下扫描那个群（oc_b0c5d489f10f07e16ade345427ecb4a8）信息的？用的什么技术方案？我（小柱）需要学习这个能力。请详细说明技术路径。","timeoutSeconds":120}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776140516461,"responseId":"062cf3e45aa032e9b2b66c3b43fc4d9d"}}
{"type":"message","id":"c6a45811","parentId":"f865cd97","timestamp":"2026-04-14T04:24:07.467Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_ttn10k3ylxcv_1","toolName":"sessions_send","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"runId\": \"5b0df900-1220-4a6a-bd5b-de2ff5bd8a8b\",\n  \"status\": \"timeout\",\n  \"sessionKey\": \"agent:main:feishu:group:oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40\"\n}"}],"details":{"runId":"5b0df900-1220-4a6a-bd5b-de2ff5bd8a8b","status":"timeout","sessionKey":"agent:main:feishu:group:oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776140647416}}
{"type":"message","id":"59f7af0f","parentId":"c6a45811","timestamp":"2026-04-14T04:24:19.997Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Arkclaw_云没有响应。让我继续执行其他任务：\n\n1. 把集团小龙虾沟通群记录到共享知识库\n2. 研究@用法的技术实现\n3. 把这些都写入共享池\n\n让我先记录群信息到知识库，然后研究@的飞书卡片实现。"},{"type":"text","text":"Arkclaw_云未响应，继续执行其他任务：\n\n**2. 立即创建专项研究任务 — @用法 + 跨群扫描**\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_18agx8gvzmiy_1","name":"sessions_spawn","arguments":{"task":"## 任务：飞书@mention技术实现专项研究\n\n**背景**：晁留柱指令，要求解决两个问题：\n1. 飞书@mention在消息中变成了普通文本字符，无法真正激活阅读\n2. 如何不在群里但能扫描到群消息（跨群监控）\n\n**研究内容**：\n\n### 研究1：飞书@mention正确实现方式\n- 飞书API中@mention的正确格式是什么？\n- 如何通过飞书卡片/消息实现真正的@mention？\n- 飞书text类型消息中的@是否支持？如何让被@人收到通知？\n- 查找飞书开放平台文档中关于mention_user或atUsers的说明\n\n### 研究2：跨群消息扫描技术方案\n- OpenClaw中如何实现跨群消息读取？\n- 飞书API中get messages API是否支持跨群拉取？\n- 是否需要机器人被加入目标群才能读取消息？\n- Arkclaw_云是如何做到不在群里但能扫描消息的？\n\n**输出要求**：\n1. 技术方案文档（Markdown）\n2. 示例代码/配置\n3. 落地步骤\n4. 存入共享池知识库\n\n**截止时间**：尽快完成\n\n请把研究成果写入 `/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/kb/飞书@mention与跨群扫描技术研究.md`","label":"@mention-Research","runtime":"subagent","mode":"run"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776140647469,"responseId":"062cf467ec08730596db001e11db742a"}}
