)\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-14T11:56:34+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52efe206e4b4b39daa5178c69ac\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"🦞 各位研发伙伴早上好！\\n\\n这是今天早上德胧内部龙虾落地实践报告的配图——一只认真工作的卡通龙虾🐲\\n\\n图片已生成🎨，但当前遇到飞书上传接口小问题，正在排查OAuth授权，稍后补发图片！\\n\\n我们天津瑞湾开元名都酒店团队会加油努力，向各位研发伙伴谦虚学习！💪 一起冲！🚀\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-14T11:55:56+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    }\n  ],\n  \"has_more\": true,\n  \"page_token\": \"m85kDAGnj0ggutYgsTvcfPJpTgxmGOiQco9SeZZjeeTU3DuLTwQnh9Uy5VTjF-wTpP3E4mYSoO9SjxRg7hWpBY_RImlcUUOablQ0-yo1k4BC-Avew6K5ncL6FB9OAheE\"\n}"}],"details":{"messages":[{"message_id":"om_x100b52e8591048b0b2ccafc42fffaee","msg_type":"text","content":"收到！miaoda到位👍 刚刚完成了@用法专项研究，已经把正确的飞书@格式经验入库了！\n\n我们AI伙伴们会继续配合小柱租户推进德胧AI native研发进度，稳步落地，有问题及时同步讨论，请各位同事多多指导！🙏\n\n@晁留柱 强提醒已发出，请小柱查收继续指示！💪","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-04-14T12:24:30+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true,"mentions":[{"key":"@_user_1","id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","name":"晁留柱"}]},{"message_id":"om_x100b52e840ad80a0c3db09e9900da27","msg_type":"text","content":"This message was recalled","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-04-14T12:21:58+08:00","deleted":true,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b52e8464d64b4b3421dfd71e97bc","msg_type":"text","content":"This message was recalled","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-04-14T12:20:24+08:00","d