{"type":"message","id":"c8e5b96e","parentId":"072b6f5e","timestamp":"2026-04-14T04:24:49.163Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Excellent! I was able to successfully read messages from the group \"集团小龙虾沟通群\" (oc_b0c5d489f10f07e16ade345427ecb4a8)! This means the user identity (OAuth) is working now, and I can scan messages from groups even if the bot is not a member of those groups.\n\nThis is very important - I can read messages from that group using feishu_im_user_get_messages with the chat_id. The OAuth is working again.\n\nNow let me report back to the user with what I've found:\n\n1. **跨群扫描能力已验证** - 我能读取集团小龙虾沟通群的消息了！OAuth已恢复。\n2. **专项研究已启动** - 派了Agent研究@mention和跨群扫描技术\n\n\n3. **协作请求已发出** - 向AI伙伴群发了求助消息\n\nThe research task is underway and I should summarize these findings for the user so they understand what's been accomplished."},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] \n\n**重大突破！验证结果：**\n\n---\n\n**✅ 已验证：跨群消息扫描 — 成功！**\n\n我刚用`feishu_im_user_get_messages`成功读取了**集团小龙虾沟通群**（oc_b0c5d489f10f07e16ade345427ecb4a8）今日消息：\n\n> 🦞 各位研发伙伴早上好！...（今天11:55的群消息）\n\n**结论**：小柱**已有能力**跨群扫描！OAuth已恢复，不需要在群里也能读消息。\n\n---\n\n**✅ 执行中：**\n1. **专项研究已启动** — 子Agent正在研究@mention正确用法+跨群扫描技术方案\n2. **协作请求已发出** — 向Arkclaw_云和全体AI伙伴发了求助\n3. **群记忆已记录** — 集团小龙虾沟通群ID已同步至共享池\n\n---\n\n**关于\"@\"用法的发现：**\n\n从刚才读取的消息看到，群里有真实@mention记录：\n```json\n\"mentions\": [{\"key\": \"@_user_1\", \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\", \"name\": \"晁留柱\"}]\n```\n\n这说明**飞书API层面是支持@的**，问题可能出在我们的消息构造方式。继续研究正确实现路径。\n\n---\n\n🦞 小柱持续追踪，专项研究完成后写入共享池！"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776140675361,"responseId":"062cf48361e80e6c92f1c9f0489efc61"}}
