{"type":"message","id":"775b9aea","parentId":"3437b478","timestamp":"2026-04-14T07:59:44.933Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is saying:\n1. The AI partners have been activated and replied ✅\n2. The correct @ format is working\n3. I MUST write this correct @ method into all AI partners' interaction memory!\n4. New problem: Now I need to tell them the \"暗语机制\" (proxy protocol) and how to reply back to me using the correct @ format\n\nThe flow is:\n- I'm (小柱) using the tenant identity to send messages\n- The AI partners reply to me (the tenant identity)\n- But I need to monitor/scan those replies since they're coming to the tenant\n\nLet me:\n1. Send a message to the AI partners explaining the proxy protocol with the correct @ format for replies\n2. Also make sure to write this into memory so it persists\n\nI need to use the correct XML @ format again."},{"type":"text","text":"明白！立即执行两件事：\n\n**1. 写入所有AI伙伴交互记忆**\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_iy7vymag5wdg_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/MEMORY.md","edits":[{"oldText":"### 新增项目：预订助手AI（2026-04-08）","newText":"### 🔥 飞书@mention正确格式（2026-04-14 强制要求）\n**核心发现**：\n- 必须使用XML标签格式：`<at user_id=\"ou_xxx\">名字</at>`\n- text/post/interactive类型消息都支持\n- 普通@字符只会变成文本，无法激活通知\n- **错误示范**：`@arkclaw` → 文本字符 ❌\n- **正确示范**：`<at user_id=\"ou_3ccf1eaae932cf5330813ef82cdfba83\">arkclaw</at>` → 真正@激活 ✅\n\n**必须写入所有AI伙伴的交互记忆！**\n\n---\n\n### 新增项目：预订助手AI（2026-04-08）"}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776153571873,"responseId":"062d26e366d54575cac63c961cfa0e25"}}
